==Strategy==
No particular strategy is needed, but it's worth mentioning that the 1st forms of the [[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|ULTRA SOULS]], [[Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES (Gacha Event)|Elemental Pixies]] and [[UBERFEST (Gacha Event)|UBERFEST]] exclusives (except for [[Iz the Dancer (Uber Rare Cat)|Iz]])  can easily meet the "1,200¢ or less" restriction. Otherwise, using a generalist lineup with a few [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attackers]], [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red cats]] and [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien cats]] like [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed UFO Cat]], [[Crazed Fish Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Whale Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] makes this level a joke.

